		<unit label="chapter" identifier="7" level="4">Requirements Applicable to Underground Coal Mines; Mine Construction</unit>
		<unit label="article" identifier="4" level="5">Roof, Face, and Rib Control</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>45.2-712</section_number>
	<catch_line> Copies of plan</catch_line>
	<text>
		The operator or his agent shall, upon request, furnish a copy of the roof control plan to any miner engaged in removing or installing a temporary or permanent roof support.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 45-68.2; 1954, c. 191; 1966, c. 594, § 45.1-40; 1975, c. 520; 1978, c. 729; 1984, c. 590; 1994, c. 28, § 45.1-161.111; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
